{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "広島に上陸しています！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いていただき、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございます！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "埼玉県出身のえんどうりこです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "京都リアルミート&グリート"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "暑い中、足を運んでくださった皆さん"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございました！！！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobsh8qQQ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "パシャっ📸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "京都の浴衣はね幕張の時とは真逆の浴衣を選んでみたよ〜。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "幕張はピンクで可愛い系！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "京都は紺色でおとなしめ！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなはどっち派かな？"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobdnOlKk.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobMcov2t.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobye1OoI.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "3枚とも違う表情してる"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちょい照れ。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "にこっ。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ふふっ。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "って感じ！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "つたわるかな〜？笑笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなと話してる時はどんな顔してたー？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "きっと、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とびきりの笑顔だったはず、、、、！！！！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobCB5SRT.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "凪ちゃん！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "顔に髪がかかってる感じかわいい〜。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近は隙あれば"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「筋肉をつけられるように頑張ろう」"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "という話し合いをしています。笑💃"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobG9QeQm.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この前ツアーの楽屋でお隣座った！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ずっと面白くてたのしくて"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "晶保さんのまわりは笑い声が絶えません☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "晶保さんとれなさんとの会話のテンポ感が個人的にお気に入りです。🤫"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobJ3etmt.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/moboOBloK.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回はれいなちゃんに"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "着付けてもらいました🙌"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "帯はね、りかちゃんが"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "綺麗なリボン？作ってくれた！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2人とも短時間で綺麗に着付けてくれて、、、。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "感謝です！！！！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobBj1kZo.png", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなからのお花💐☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いろんなコンセプトのお花たち"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "見てるとワクワクする〜。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当にみんなのセンスの良さ、尊敬します🫡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "素敵なお花、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "沢山考えてくれてありがとう〜！！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobIc3g5E.png", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂カフェ中期メニュー見てくれた〜？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "可愛くて美味しそうなメニューがいっぱい！！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "全部頼みたくなるね🤔"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなはもう何かたのんだー？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひ足を運んでいただけたら嬉しいです！🙌"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「わんけーき」も"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひ食べてみてねー。🐶ﾜﾝｯ"}, 